+ marketplace thismoon -> {HOME}/sources/thismoon
  $ {HOME}/bin/claude plugin marketplace add {HOME}/sources/thismoon --scope user
+ install one-tag-matches@thismoon
  $ {HOME}/bin/claude plugin install one-tag-matches@thismoon --scope user
+ install no-gate@thismoon
  $ {HOME}/bin/claude plugin install no-gate@thismoon --scope user
+ install empty-gate@thismoon
  $ {HOME}/bin/claude plugin install empty-gate@thismoon --scope user
(dry-run, no changes applied)
